        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6MRIOqcBUUnn1noAmHHEZZClSUU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/277804-egg-white-breakfast-casserole-VAT-step-03-f42f214cb155487987bcb8a21b68742e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/277804/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, saute mushrooms and onion in a pan until softened, 5 to 10 minutes.",
